msgstr "Aksies"

#: configdialog.cpp:49
msgid "&Shortcuts"
msgstr "Kortpaaie"

#: configdialog.cpp:93
msgid "&Popup menu at mouse-cursor position"
msgstr "Opspring kieslys na mouse-cursor posisie"

#: configdialog.cpp:95
msgid "Save clipboard contents on e&xit"
msgstr "Stoor klipbord inhoud op beïendig"

#: configdialog.cpp:97
msgid "&Replay actions on an item selected from history"
msgstr "Weerspeel aksies op 'n item gekose van geskiedenis"

#: configdialog.cpp:100
msgid "Pre&vent empty clipboard"
msgstr "Verhoed leeg klipbord"

#: configdialog.cpp:102
msgid ""
"Selecting this option has the effect, that the clipboard can never be "
"emptied. E.g. when an application exits, the clipboard would usually be "
"emptied."
msgstr ""
"Deur te kies hierdie opsie het die effek, wat die klipbord kan moet nooit "
"wees leeg gemaak word nie. E.g. wanneer 'n aansoek uitgaan, die klipbord sal "
"gewoonlik wees leeg gemaak word nie."

#: configdialog.cpp:107
msgid "&Ignore selection"
msgstr "Ignoreer keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:109
msgid ""
"This option prevents the selection being recorded in the clipboard history. "
"Only explicit clipboard changes are recorded."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie voorkom die keuse te wees opgeneem in die klipbord "
"geskiedenis. Slegs eksplisiet klipbord verander word opgeneem."

#: configdialog.cpp:113
msgid "Clipboard/Selection Behavior"
msgstr "Klipbord/Keuse Gedrag"

#: configdialog.cpp:117
msgid ""
"<qt>There are two different clipboard buffers "
"available:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>Clipboard</b> is filled by selecting something"
"<br>and pressing Ctrl+C, or by clicking \"Copy\" in a toolbar "
"or"
"<br>menubar."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Selection</b> is available immediately after"
"<br>selecting some text. The only way to access the selection"
"<br>is to press the middle mouse button."
"<br>"
"<br>You can configure the relationship between Clipboard and Selection.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Daar word twee ander klipbord buffers beskikbaar:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>klipbord</b> is gevul deur deur te kies iets"
"<br>en gedruk Ctrl+C, of deur te kliek \"Kopie\" in 'n nutsbalk "
"of"
"<br>kiesbalk."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Keuse</b> is beskikbaar dadelik na"
"<br>deur te kies sommige teks. Die slegs weg na toegang verkry Die "
"Keuse"
"<br>is na druk Die middelste muis knoppie."
"<br><br>Jy kan konfigureer Die verhouding tussen klipbord en Keuse.</qt>"

#: configdialog.cpp:128
msgid "Sy&nchronize contents of the clipboard and the selection"
msgstr "Sinkroniseer inhoud van die klipbord en die keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:131
msgid ""
"Selecting this option synchronizes these two buffers, so they work the same "
"way as in KDE 1.x and 2.x."
msgstr ""
"Deur te kies hierdie opsie sinkroniseer hierdie twee buffers, sodat hulle "
"werk die selfde weg as in Kde 1.x en 2.x."

#: configdialog.cpp:135
msgid "Separate clipboard and selection"
msgstr "Aparte klipbord en keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:138
msgid ""
"Using this option will only set the selection when highlighting something "
"and the clipboard when choosing e.g. \"Copy\" in a menubar."
msgstr ""
"Te gebruik hierdie opsie sal slegs stel die keuse wanneer verligting iets en "
"die klipbord wanneer kies e.g. \"Kopie\" in 'n kiesbalk."

#: configdialog.cpp:146
msgid "Tim&eout for action popups:"
msgstr "Tydverstreke vir aksie opspring:"

#: configdialog.cpp:148
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: configdialog.cpp:149
msgid "A value of 0 disables the timeout"
msgstr "'n waarde van 0 deaktiveer die tydverstreke"

#: configdialog.cpp:152
msgid "C&lipboard history size:"
msgstr "Klipbord geskiedenis grootte:"

#: configdialog.cpp:174
msgid ""
"_n:  entry\n"
" entries"
msgstr ""
"inskrywing\n"
" inskrywings"

#: configdialog.cpp:220
msgid "Action &list (right click to add/remove commands):"
msgstr "Aksie lys (regterkant kliek na voeg by/verwyder opdragte):"

#: configdialog.cpp:224
msgid "Regular Expression (see http://doc.trolltech.com/qregexp.html#details)"
msgstr "Gewone Uitdrukking (sien http://dok.trolltech.com/qregexp.html#details)"

#: configdialog.cpp:225
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrywing"

#: configdialog.cpp:277
msgid "&Use graphical editor for editing regular expressions"
msgstr "Gebruik grafiese redigeerder vir redigering gewone uitdrukkings"

#: configdialog.cpp:286
msgid "&Add Action"
msgstr "Voeg by Aksie"

#: configdialog.cpp:289
msgid "&Delete Action"
msgstr "Uitvee Aksie"

#: configdialog.cpp:292
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Click on a highlighted item's column to change it. \"%s\" in a command will "
"be replaced with the clipboard contents."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op 'n verlig item se kolom na verander dit. \"%s\" in 'n opdrag sal "
"wees vervang met die klipbord inhoud."

#: configdialog.cpp:298
msgid "Advanced..."
msgstr "Gevorderde..."

#: configdialog.cpp:323
msgid "Add Command"
msgstr "Voeg by Opdrag"

#: configdialog.cpp:324
msgid "Remove Command"
msgstr "Verwyder Opdrag"

#: configdialog.cpp:334
msgid "Click here to set the command to be executed"
msgstr "Kliek hier na stel die opdrag na wees uitgevoerde"

#: configdialog.cpp:335
msgid "<new command>"
msgstr "<new command>"

#: configdialog.cpp:357
msgid "Click here to set the regexp"
msgstr "Kliek hier na stel die regexp"

#: configdialog.cpp:358
msgid "<new action>"
msgstr "<new action>"

#: configdialog.cpp:398
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Gevorderde Instellings"

#: configdialog.cpp:415
msgid "D&isable Actions for Windows of Type WM_CLASS"
msgstr "Deaktiveer Aksies vir Vensters van Tipe WM_CLASS"

#: configdialog.cpp:418
msgid ""
"<qt>This lets you specify windows in which klipper should"
"<br>not invoke \"actions\". Use"
"<center><b>xprop | grep WM_CLASS</b></center>in a terminal to find out the "
"WM_CLASS of a window."
"<br>Next, click on the window you want to examine. The"
"<br>first string it outputs after the equal sign is the one"
"<br>you need to enter here.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Hierdie laat jy jy spesifiseer vensters in wat klipper moet"
"<br>nie aktiveer \"aksies\". Gebruik"
"<center><b>xprop | grep WM_CLASS</b></center>"
"in 'n terminaal na soek uit die WM_CLASS van 'n venster."
"<br>Volgende, kliek op die venster jy wil hê na ondersoek. die"
"<br>eerste string dit uitsette na die gelyk teken is die een"
"<br>jy benodig na invoer hier.</qt>"

